1
00:00:00,166 --> 00:00:01,166
Let me do it.

2
00:00:05,296 --> 00:00:06,296
Oh.

3
00:00:06,923 --> 00:00:07,632
Are you okay?

4
00:00:07,632 --> 00:00:09,009
Oh, sorry, I slipped.

5
00:00:10,218 --> 00:00:11,218
Let's go.

6
00:00:16,224 --> 00:00:17,392
The Principal was

7
00:00:18,768 --> 00:00:20,228
really disappointed
when I said

8
00:00:21,062 --> 00:00:22,105
I won't clean anymore.

9
00:00:23,189 --> 00:00:25,942
He was almost cursing at us
saying our club is doomed.

10
00:00:27,816 --> 00:00:28,883
You're not injured, right?

11
00:00:29,112 --> 00:00:30,739
Of course, It was just a slip.

12
00:00:31,239 --> 00:00:32,573
If it really hurts

13
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:34,366
then you must tell me.

14
00:00:36,661 --> 00:00:37,661
Okay.

15
00:00:38,955 --> 00:00:39,955
Our guys

16
00:00:40,331 --> 00:00:42,011
are really giving it
their all, don't they?

17
00:00:42,042 --> 00:00:43,042
Yeah.

18
00:00:43,084 --> 00:00:45,170
They got a lot better
than I first saw them.

19
00:00:45,712 --> 00:00:46,545
We should get back

20
00:00:46,546 --> 00:00:47,630
to practice with them.

21
00:00:47,922 --> 00:00:48,922
Yeah.

22
00:00:51,801 --> 00:00:53,011
He'll be fine I suppose.

23
00:01:00,477 --> 00:01:01,269
Hey, the ball!

24
00:01:01,269 --> 00:01:02,269
Ugh!

25
00:01:02,353 --> 00:01:04,647
Why didn't you pay attention
while catching the ball?

26
00:01:05,190 --> 00:01:05,648
I'm sorry.

27
00:01:05,774 --> 00:01:07,233
Hey, where were you looking?

28
00:01:07,609 --> 00:01:08,609
I mean...

29
00:01:11,112 --> 00:01:11,571
Sorry.

30
00:01:11,946 --> 00:01:12,970
Keep doing without me.

31
00:01:13,823 --> 00:01:14,823
Hey!

32
00:01:14,949 --> 00:01:15,950
Hey, where are you going?

33
00:01:16,868 --> 00:01:18,995
How am I supposed to
do this alone?

34
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:23,540
Are you okay?

35
00:01:23,625 --> 00:01:24,834
I'm sorry, Jeongho.

36
00:01:26,127 --> 00:01:27,420
I don't think I can do this.
